flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer Workstation] --> Repo[GitHub Repository]
    Repo --> PR[Pull Request]
    PR --> Gates[Security Gates]
    Gates --> SAST[Bandit / Semgrep]
    Gates --> SCA[pip-audit / Dependency Review]
    Gates --> FS[Trivy FS + Secrets + IaC]
    Gates --> Build[Docker Build]
    Build --> ImageScan[Trivy Image Scan]
    ImageScan --> SBOM[Syft SBOM]
    SBOM --> Sign[Cosign Signing / Attestation]
    Sign --> Registry[Container Registry]
    Registry --> GitOps[Argo CD GitOps]
    GitOps --> Admission[Gatekeeper / Kyverno]
    Admission --> K8s[Kubernetes Cluster]
    K8s --> Runtime[Falco Runtime Detection]
    Runtime --> Reports[Evidence + Retest Reports]
